# RECONCILE_ShowSession
# Parameter: the session PrimaryKey. Shows every row of that session, sorted.
Set Error Capture [ On ]
Go to Layout [ "import_RECONCILE" ; Animation: None ]
Enter Find Mode [ Pause: Off ]
Set Field [ import_RECONCILE::fkImportSession ; "==" & Get ( ScriptParameter ) ]
Perform Find [ ]
Sort Records [ Restore ; With dialog: Off ]
Go to Record/Request/Page [ First ]
